Agastya resumes Daṇḍa story for Rāma --- Daṇḍa rules thornless kingdom many years --- Daṇḍa visits Bhārgava hermitage in Caitra month --- Daṇḍa sees peerless daughter Arajā in woods --- Daṇḍa pleads lovesickness and asks her birth --- Arajā warns he is pupil and bids him woo her father --- Daṇḍa begs favor despite death or sin --- Daṇḍa seizes struggling Arajā and ravishes her by force --- Daṇḍa flees to Madhumanta while Arajā weeps awaiting father